 "remarks": "WOW what stunning Long Island Sound Views! This beautiful 1-bedroom unit features fresh paint, new neutral carpeting, and indoor-access for year-round comfort. Enjoy an open-plan living/dining area leading to a private balcony with breathtaking, unobstructed water views. Stylish galley kitchen with quartz countertops, stainless steel appliances and quality cabinetry. Spacious light-filled primary bedroom, and an abundance of closets/storage throughout the unit. Upgraded electrical panel! Full bath comes with tub, shower, and single vanity with granite countertop. The building amenities include a fitness center, coin-operated laundry, as well as an in-ground pool. Pet Friendly building! Conveniently located within walking distance to shops, restaurants, parks, and bus stop (No.333) in front of building 71 to Stamford railroad with express service to NYC. Assigned parking space No.9 - $25 a month. Don't miss this opportunity: schedule your showing today!",
